<title>ITALY: ENI 3rd tranche prospectus given go-ahead.</title>
<headline>ENI 3rd tranche prospectus given go-ahead.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The prospectus for the flotation of a third tranche of shares in Italy's energy giant ENI was given the go-ahead by Consob, sources at Italy's stock market watchdog said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
